{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"wilcoxon-signed-rank-test-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"wilcoxon-signed-rank-test-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["wilcoxon-signed-rank-test-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Las diferencias se calculan como después menos antes. Se omiten las diferencias de cero; las diferencias absolutas emparejadas reciben rangos promedio. La prueba es de dos lados. El método exacto se usa para pares no cero de hasta ZXQPH0000QXZ; las muestras más grandes usan una aproximación normal corregida por continuidad.","record_id":"66e0d18fa41d82dd5ef2f5ba3e3e34110632f3b75c4cfd3cf2c537d05a3187e0","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":2.301351619249999,"source":"Differences are calculated as after minus before. Zero differences are omitted; tied absolute differences receive average ranks. The test is two-sided. The exact method is used for up to 25 nonzero pairs; larger samples use a continuity-corrected normal approximation. Interpret results only when the paired study design and test assumptions are appropriate; this does not establish causation.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"1a765761011e3302fe7c67c82a6bcb7d288f7a0a81149498a1caf36422c1c122","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Las diferencias se calculan como después menos antes. Se omiten las diferencias de cero; las diferencias absolutas emparejadas reciben rangos promedio. La prueba es de dos lados. El método exacto se usa para pares no cero de hasta 25; las muestras más grandes usan una aproximación normal corregida por continuidad.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
